{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602430","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1360243001:1":{"text":"やれやれ、マーリンの奴が何をやっても驚かないけど、セレスチアルお墨付きの祭日まで作っちゃうなんて、ほんと大したものだよ。","source_cn":"哎呀呀，虽然梅林这家伙干什么都很正常，但直接创造一个有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A85E77EB124BEF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1360243002:1":{"text":"でもさあ、今回の件では僕もけっこう貢献してるよねえ？","source_cn":"只不过，这次的节日至少有一多半的功劳应该归我吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE452F708782F0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360243003:1":{"text":"そうだよ！僕にだって命名権があってもいいはずだよね！半分はベリル祭って名乗ってもいいぐらいだよ！","source_cn":"对吧对吧，明明应该是我！我也应该有冠名权！这个节日有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0390080822B38C11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360243004:1":{"text":"……いや、なんかキモいからやめよ。","source_cn":"……啊，算了，有点恶心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86AC8E31CB84F666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360243005:1":{"text":"はぁ、僕は寛大だから、人間たちの不公平も笑って許すさ。","source_cn":"算了，宽宏大量的我就这样面对人类的不公平吧，","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBF2CA65359A4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360243006:1":{"text":"にしても、今回は本当に頑張った方だと思うよ。","source_cn":"不过嘛，无论如何，我也算是尽心尽力了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDC646E6DA2A916","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360243007:1":{"text":"君たちにとって、人間が美しいと思うもののほとんどは、耐えがたい雑音と騒音でしかないもんねぇ？","source_cn":"在诸位的耳中，人类认为美妙的东西多半犹如嘈杂刺耳的噪音...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C917CBC1E26C6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360243008:1":{"text":"でも、いざ本当の騒音を聞かせたら、君たちは喜んでくれるのかなぁ？","source_cn":"但是反过来说，如果真的是噪音，诸位能否欣赏呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D6F47BB4FA2811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1360243009:1":{"text":"あはははははっ！今回は、素敵な夢を見ている君たちへの、ちょっとした挨拶ってことで！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，就当成我在诸位做着深沉美梦时的一点小小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5DA1B338BE6AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360243010:1":{"text":"だって、僕は君たちと違って――とても礼儀正しくて、人間味があるからねぇ。","source_cn":"与你们不同，我可是非——常非常有礼貌，非常人性化的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B30DB9E33EF49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume